’s visuals are directly tied to the criteria and help readers grasp the rationale for each flagged item. Score: +2 (candidate better).\n\nOverall, the candidate report shows substantially stronger visual presentation: multiple charts are used, clearly labeled, and woven into the narrative to reinforce insights. The baseline report is vague about its visual elements and lacks explicit chart integration. Final score = 7 (sum of sub‑dimensions: 3 + 2 + 2).",
