sual synergy & insightfulness**: Candidate explicitly links each visualization to specific findings and explains their business relevance; baseline mentions charts but does not integrate them into the narrative. Candidate's visual insights directly support analytical conclusions; baseline's visuals appear disconnected. Score: +3 (candidate substantially better)\n\nTotal score: +7",
