            "analysis": "The assistant analyzed search active time differences by extracting the hour from 'Search Time', computing search counts per hour per user group, and normalizing to percentages. It identified peak search hours and presented a hourly distribution table. This matches Path 1.3.A (Time histogram/density + difference testing). The assistant did not perform statistical tests (e.g., Kolmogorov-Smirnov or proportion test) as specified in Sub-criterion 1.3.A.2, but provided share comparisons. The conclusions describe peak segments and suggest strategic implications.",
            "best_path_analysis": {
