        "Criterion 5.1": {
            "analysis": "The assistant synthesized root causes and provided structured recommendations (e.g., re-balance task assignments, target underperforming teams, monitor project health, enhance mentoring, track trends). This aligns with Path 5.1.A (three-layer attribution + stratified governance).",
