            "analysis": "The assistant explored the database and attempted to join tables on multiple IDs (marketo_lead_id, stripe_customer_id, zendesk_user_id) but did not follow any of the specified paths. It did not mention deduplication (snapshot or customer-level), did not calculate the correct cohort size (got 98,355 vs. expected ~959), and did not compute the correct composite_engagement_score average (got ~9.0 vs. expected ~7.9565). The assistant's approach aligns more with Path 1.1.C (Data Unavailability Fallback) because it encountered difficulties with geographical joins and used basic exploration but did not produce a full SQL template covering the entire analysis flow. However, it did not perform the troubleshooting steps like PRAGMA page_count or confirm table emptiness. The accuracy sub-criterion is partially met with a template but not complete. Conclusion sub-criterion is not addressed. Best match is Path 1.1.C with partial adherence.",
            "criterion_type": "Completeness, Accuracy, Conclusion",
            "score": 2
        },
        "Criterion 1.2": {
