gure is explicitly referenced in the narrative (e.g., 'The following chart quantifies...') and the captions provide interpretive insight, not just description (e.g., 'This highlights a significant opportunity cost...'). The visuals are positioned as evidence for key findings. The baseline report mentions its two visuals but does not weave them into the narrative with the same level of explanatory detail; the connection is more passive (e.g., '...see boxplot'). The candidate's approach creates a more cohesive and insightful narrative flow.\n\nOverall, the candidate's report is superior in visualization effort, integration, and insight communication, though not by a large margin due to the unknown quality of the actual images and some reliance on placeholder text. The total score is +3.",
