re: +1 (slightly better).\n\n3. Text–visual synergy & insightfulness: The candidate report explicitly references each chart immediately after a table or data point (e.g., \"The visual confirms...\", \"This chart visually confirms...\", \"The bar chart clearly shows...\") and directly explains how the visual supports the insight. The baseline report also references charts but in a more generic, embedded way (e.g., \"Key Findings:\" under a chart reference). The candidate's narrative more tightly integrates the visuals as evidence, making the insights more visually grounded. Score: +1 (slightly better).\n\nOverall, the candidate report demonstrates marginally stronger visual-text integration and slightly more thoughtful chart selection, though both are largely text-driven with supplemental visuals. The total score is +3.",
